<span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Did you know that Insperity business performance solutions support more than 100,000 businesses with over 2 million employees? With over 33 years providing HR solutions to the marketplace, Insperity is recognized as a trusted advisor to America’s best businesses.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Insperity is not here to just sell you software or services, we are here to consult with you, assess your business needs, and provide the best recommendations that will help your business grow.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
You have expressed interest in our OrgPlus RealTime solution, and I would like to converse with you on your specific needs, demonstrate the power of OrgPlus for your business, and answer any questions you might have.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Let’s connect. I will be calling you in a day or so to schedule some time for us to chat. You can also reach me at {{{Sender.Email}}}.<br />
<br />
